It is generated (by internal/gen) from two datasets published by the
Character Information Technology Promotion Council (文字情報技術促進協議会),
originally produced by the Information-technology Promotion Agency, Japan
(独立行政法人情報処理推進機構, IPA), both under
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.1 Japan
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.1/jp/):

  MJ縮退マップ (MJ Shrink Map) Ver.1.2.0, issued 2018-01-26
    https://moji.or.jp/mojikiban/map/
  MJ文字情報一覧表 (MJ Character Information List) Ver.006.02, January 2024
    https://moji.or.jp/mojikiban/mjlist/

table.tsv is therefore also CC BY-SA 2.1 JP. Attribute IPA when you
redistribute it. The Unicode-derived lines (basis bit 32) come from the
Unicode Character Database, which carries the Unicode licence.
